        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "[V2G20-1234]\nEach certificate in a certificate chain shall be DER encoded and the size of each certificate in DER encoded form shall be limited to a maximum of 1 600 bytes. Refer to ITU-T X.509 for details of DER encoding.",
